      "difficulty_reason": "The author constructs a broken-circuit edge-toggle involution that preserves the relevant connected/union or rank data while reversing signs, and proves compatibility with arbitrary selected broken-circuit weights. The same mechanism survives ambigraph edge structure and general coefficient targets, including vertex weights/noncommuting chromatic variables, and yields the matroid characteristic-polynomial identity. Ambigraph and matroid formulations are one cancellation object, not separate counts; all standard Whitney/NBC specializations and applications are context.",
